<p>The extra source picture showing the hidden stick uses one <strong>unequal</strong> split, with most of the street shaded. Students estimate a fraction and explain why. Do not auto-grade an answer of 1/2 merely because the drawing has two unequal regions. Original artwork and the restricted publisher Cool-down are not embedded.</p>
<p>Teacher reviews partner-created shaded boards, physical card draws, complete strip diagrams, the extra estimated stick position and explanations. <a href="https://im.kendallhunt.com/k5/teachers/grade-3/unit-5/lesson-4/lesson.html">Reference: original 2021 teacher lesson</a>.</p>
